trust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.880" end="00:42.010"><span begin="00:39.880" end="00:40.150">The </span><span begin="00:40.150" end="00:40.630">lessons </span><span begin="00:40.630" end="00:40.900">that </span><span begin="00:40.900" end="00:41.080">you </span><span begin="00:41.080" end="00:41.440">taught </span><span begin="00:41.440" end="00:42.010">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.070" end="00:44.020"><span begin="00:42.070" end="00:42.280">I </span><span begin="00:42.280" end="00:42.640">learn </span><span begin="00:42.640" end="00:42.730">were </span><span begin="00:42.730" end="00:43.270">never </span><span begin="00:43.270" end="00:44.020">true</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.200" end="00:46.480"><span begin="00:44.200" end="00:44.470">Now </span><span begin="00:44.470" end="00:44.560">I </span><span begin="00:44.560" end="00:44.890">find </span><span begin="00:44.890" end="00:45.370">myself </span><span begin="00:45.370" end="00:45.550">in </span><span begin="00:45.550" end="00:46.480">question</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.510" end="00:48.640"><span begin="00:46.510" end="00:46.780">They </span><span begin="00:46.780" end="00:47.130">point </span><span begin="00:47.130" end="00:47.220">the </span><span begin="00:47.220" end="00:47.710">finger </span><span begin="00:47.710" end="00:47.890">at </span><span begin="00:47.890" end="00:48.190">me </span><span begin="00:48.190" end="00:48.640">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.700" end="00:50.830"><span begin="00:48.700" end="00:48.970">Guilty </span><span begin="00:48.970" end="00:49.300">by </span><span begin="00:49.300" end="00:50.830">association</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.860" end="00:53.110"><span begin="00:50.860" end="00:51.250">You </span><span begin="00:51.250" end="00:51.460">point </span><span begin="00:51.460" end="00:51.550">the </span><span begin="00:51.550" end="00:52.180">finger </span><span begin="00:52.180" end="00:52.270">at </span><span begin="00:52.270" end="00:52.600">me </span><span begin="00:52.600" end="00:53.110">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.140" end="00:55.660"><span begin="00:53.140" end="00:53.380">I </span><span begin="00:53.380" end="00:53.920">wanna </span><span begin="00:53.920" end="00:54.370">run </span><span begin="00:54.370" end="00:55.660">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.660" end="00:57.430"><span begin="00:55.660" end="00:56.020">Never </span><span begin="00:56.020" end="00:56.470">say </span><span begin="00:56.470" end="00:57.430">goodbye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.430" end="00:59.680"><span begin="00:57.430" end="00:57.730">I </span><span begin="00:57.730" end="00:58.270">wanna </span><span begin="00:58.270" end="00:58.660">know </span><span begin="00:58.660" end="00:59.050">the </span><span begin="00:59.050" end="00:59.680">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.710" end="01:01.900"><span begin="00:59.710" end="01:00.340">Instead </span><span begin="01:00.340" end="01:00.520">of </span><span begin="01:00.520" end="01:01.330">wondering </span><span begin="01:01.330" end="01:01.900">why</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.900" end="01:04.840"><span begin="01:01.900" end="01:02.140">I </span><span begin="01:02.140" end="01:02.650">wanna </span><span begin="01:02.650" end="01:03.070">know </span><span begin="01:03.070" end="01:03.610">the </span><span begin="01:03.610" end="01:04.840">answers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.840" end="01:06.640"><span begin="01:04.840" end="01:05.290">No </span><span begin="01:05.290" end="01:05.740">more </span><span begin="01:05.740" end="01:06.640">lies</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.640" end="01:08.470"><span begin="01:06.640" end="01:06.670">I </span><span begin="01:06.670" end="01:07.030">wanna </span><span begin="01:07.030" end="01:07.450">shut </span><span begin="01:07.450" end="01:07.870">the </span><span begin="01:07.870" end="01:08.470">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.500" end="01:11.500"><span begin="01:08.500" end="01:08.860">And </span><span begin="01:08.860" end="01:09.400">open </span><span begin="01:09.400" end="01:09.670">up </span><span begin="01:09.670" end="01:10.120">my </span><span begin="01:10.120" end="01:11.500">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.910" end="01:15.070"><span begin="01:12.910" end="01:13.180">Paper </span><span begin="01:13.180" end="01:13.510">bags </span><span begin="01:13.510" end="01:13.690">and </span><span begin="01:13.690" end="01:14.080">angry </span><span begin="01:14.080" end="01:15.070">voices</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.130" end="01:17.230"><span begin="01:15.130" end="01:15.640">Under </span><span begin="01:15.640" end="01:15.700">a </span><span begin="01:15.700" end="01:16.150">sky </span><span begin="01:16.150" end="01:16.330">of </span><span begin="01:16.330" end="01:17.230">dust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.320" end="01:19.420"><span begin="01:17.320" end="01:17.920">Another </span><span begin="01:17.920" end="01:18.310">wave </span><span begin="01:18.310" end="01:18.490">of </span><span begin="01:18.490" end="01:19.420">tension</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.450" end="01:21.640"><span begin="01:19.450" end="01:19.810">Has </span><span begin="01:19.810" end="01:20.020">more </span><span begin="01:20.020" end="01:20.200">than </span><span begin="01:20.200" end="01:20.500">filled </span><span begin="01:20.500" end="01:20.800">me </span><span begin="01:20.800" end="01:21.640">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.700" end="01:23.800"><span begin="01:21.700" end="01:21.850">All </span><span begin="01:21.850" end="01:21.940">my </span><span begin="01:21.940" end="01:22.300">talk </span><span begin="01:22.300" end="01:22.390">of </span><span begin="01:22.390" end="01:22.990">taking </span><span begin="01:22.990" end="01:23.800">action</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.830" end="01:25.810"><spa